            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deborah B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an easy, yummy, budget-friendly dish, but I'd suggest one or two little changes. I didn't have MSG, or want to use it, so I added one of the ramen flavor packets to the dressing instead. Also, don't waste your money on bagged coleslaw mix- one small cabbage is about the same as two 16 oz bags of mix, and it only takes a few minutes to chop up."
          },
