              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SallySueW"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very bland. Luckily I had thrown in a little bit of Cayanne pepper. As a meal itself, I wouldn’t recommend. But we did fill taco shells with it, and enjoyed it that way.",
