              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I too skipped the MSG and just added a packet of seasoning from the Ramen to the dressing. Because of that I left out the salt. This was good and it is one I'd make again. It goes great with BBQ.",
