              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "raudakind"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really tasty &amp; refreshing. I used thin &amp; salty \"Chinese\" (probably Danish) noodles instead of ramen noodles. I also substituted the coleslaw with napa cabbage &amp; left out the MSG. You can skip the chicken unless you want to eat a balanced meal.",
