            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChristineB"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love the dressing. The only difference I made was to use red wine vinegar instead of white... and since I don't eat chicken I just ommitted that part. My husband loved it! Oh, and I left out the MSG!",
            "datePublished": "2008-11-05T13:22:33.100Z"
          },
