              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TWINSNMORE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love how extremely easy this is to make and how nice that the ingredients are pretty limited and ones I usually have on hand in my house. The dressing has a nice flavor to it. I halved the entire recipe but still added one whole can of chicken and two packages of ramen. Next time, I think I might try adding some almonds and/or cherry tomatoes. Thanks for the recipe!",
